    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy are delighted to present New to Market No.2 Kildalloge Heights, Strokestown. Considered to represent a premier opportunity to acquire a spacious 3-bedroom semi-detached home in a mature, highly sought-after residential setting. Perfectly designed for family living, the ground floor offers a welcoming front porch, a bright and inviting living room, a separate sitting/dining room , a practical kitchen, and a highly functional dedicated utility room. A significant asset to the property is its adjoining garage, presenting excellent scope for future room conversion (subject to planning permission). Upstairs features three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom. Boasting excellent curb appeal with a neat lawn and private driveway, this property enjoys a prime location within easy reach of all local amenities in Strokestown, making it an exceptional prospect for growing families, first-time buyers, or discerning investors. Immediate Enquiries are advised and invited. \n\nOutside\nMature and Private front and rear Gardens. Off Street Parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent Town Location\nAll Amenities on your doorstep\nMature Setting\nAdjoining Garage offering potential subject to PP\nFront porch, living room, sitting/dining room, kitchen and utility room. Adjoining garage presents future room conversion (subject to planning permission) \n All Main Services Available. \n Highly convenient area, offering a superb range of local amenities right on its doorstep in Strokestown. As the property is positioned within short walking distance of the historic town center, it gives prospective buyers effortless access to everything required for modern family life."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER Number: 119828598"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Situated within Strokestown, convenient to all amenities. From Strokestown town center, the property is just a quick 2-minute drive or a short walk away. Head north on Elphin Street (R368) toward the church, then take a right turn directly into the Kildalloge Heights housing development. As you enter the estate, No. 2 is positioned prominently near the entrance on your left-hand side. F42 VP08"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Seamus Carthy"
      }
